---
// Componente: Expediente de Usuario (Sobre Mí)
---

<article class="visor-content w-full h-full flex flex-col justify-center text-white p-4 md:p-8 relative">
  
  <header class="flex justify-between items-end border-b border-white/20 pb-2 mb-6">
    <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-4xl text-white tracking-widest uppercase drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)]">
      AGENTE / <span class="text-pink-500">PERFIL</span>
    </h2>
    <span class="font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-widest text-cyan-400 animate-pulse">
      STATUS: ONLINE_
    </span>
  </header>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 md:gap-8 items-center">
    
    <div class="md:col-span-4 lg:col-span-3 relative group">
      <div class="absolute -inset-2 border-2 border-white/30 opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:border-pink-500 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none" style="clip-path: polygon(0 0, 20% 0, 20% 5%, 5% 5%, 5% 20%, 0 20%, 0 80%, 5% 80%, 5% 95%, 20% 95%, 20% 100%, 0 100%, 100% 100%, 80% 100%, 80% 95%, 95% 95%, 95% 80%, 100% 80%, 100% 20%, 95% 20%, 95% 5%, 80% 5%, 80% 0, 100% 0);"></div>
      
      <div class="aspect-square bg-neutral-900 relative overflow-hidden border border-white/10">
        <img 
          src="/images/wilmer-profile.jpg" 
          alt="Wilmer Carrasco" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover mix-blend-luminosity opacity-80 group-hover:mix-blend-normal group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500" 
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:100%_4px] pointer-events-none"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-8 lg:col-span-9 flex flex-col justify-center">
      
      <ul class="font-mono text-xs md:text-sm tracking-widest text-white/60 space-y-2 mb-6">
        <li class="flex items-center">
          <span class="w-24 text-pink-500">ID_NOM:</span>
          <span class="text-white">WILMER CARRASCO</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center">
          <span class="w-24 text-pink-500">BASE:</span>
          <span class="text-white uppercase">Perú (Latam)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center">
          <span class="w-24 text-pink-500">EDAD:</span>
          <span class="text-white">24</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center">
          <span class="w-24 text-pink-500">ROL:</span>
          <span class="text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-400/10 px-2 py-0.5 border border-cyan-400/30">FULL-STACK & UI/UX</span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="relative bg-black/40 border-l-2 border-pink-500 p-4">
        <p class="font-sans text-sm md:text-base text-white/80 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Ingeniero de software y diseñador gráfico. Especializado en crear aplicaciones nativas, plataformas web y construir identidades visuales contundentes. Si involucra código o diseño, lo construyo para que sea funcional y visualmente innegable.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-block w-2 h-4 bg-white/80 animate-pulse ml-1 align-middle"></span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 font-mono text-[8px] text-white/30 tracking-[0.2em] hidden md:block">
    SYS. VER. 2.0.26 // AUTH: GRANTED
  </div>

</article>